// M1 test groove library

SeqClear
Time 4
Timesig 4 4

Begin Chord Define
    TLCH1   1 4 90 ; 3 4 90
End

Begin Bass Define
    TLBA1   1 4 1 90
End

Begin Drum Define
    TLDR1   1 4 100
End

Begin Chord
    Sequence TLCH1
    Voice Piano1
End

Begin Bass
    Sequence TLBA1
    Voice AcousticBass
End

Begin Drum
    Sequence TLDR1
    Tone LowTom1
End

DefGroove TestGroove   A simple test groove.
